# Expectation record for 06_control_flow/007_conditional_operator.c
#
# Reproduce one cell by hand with no harness: render the three command templates
# below, substituting the target triple, the optimization level, the source path,
# the output path, and the target's runner (empty on the natively executing target).

program            = 007_conditional_operator
area               = 06_control_flow
description        = Conditional operator result typing and single-branch evaluation, with the un-taken branch's absence observed through a volatile counter and pointer selection observed only by comparison
targets            = x86_64, i686, aarch64, riscv64
opt_levels         = -O0, -O1, -O2
shared_flags       = -static
bcc_command        = $BCC --target <triple> <opt> -static <src> -o <out>
ref_command        = $REF_CC_<TRIPLE> <opt> -static <src> -o <out>
run_command        = <runner> <out>
expect_exit        = 0
oracle_a           = enabled
oracle_b           = enabled
oracle_c           = enabled
ub_notes           <<END
Free of undefined and unspecified behaviour. Single-branch evaluation is an
absence assertion, so the side-effect counter branch_calls is declared volatile:
a plain counter could legally be removed by dead-code elimination, which would
make the assertion vacuous. Every object is assigned before it is read; the
static const array sel4 has a complete initialiser and the out array is fully
written by the four-iteration loop before any element is read. All arithmetic is
on int values of small magnitude, so no signed overflow is possible. There are
no shifts and no divisions. The two automatic objects x and y are distinct
addressable objects in the same function; their addresses are only compared for
equality, never dereferenced through a converted type and never printed, so
there is no aliasing violation and no dependence on relative addresses beyond
the defined equality comparison. The conditional operator imposes a sequence
point after its controlling expression, and each volatile object is read exactly
once into a plain local before use, so no expression contains two volatile
accesses whose relative order would be unspecified. No object is modified twice
between sequence points. The only floating-point values are 1.0 and 2.5, both
exactly representable, printed at fixed precision. The single loop has a fixed
bound of four iterations and always terminates.
END
impl_defined_notes <<END
Nothing implementation-defined is observed. Every sizeof in this program is
applied to a conditional expression whose common type is int, double or float,
so the printed sizes are 4, 4, 8 and 4 on all four targets; sizeof is never
applied to long, to a pointer, to size_t or to ptrdiff_t, whose widths were
measured to differ (4 bytes on i686, 8 elsewhere). Each sizeof result is cast to
int and printed with %d, so the size_t width itself is never exposed. The (char)
and (short) casts appear only inside sizeof, where only the promoted operand's
size is observed, so the measured plain-char signedness difference (signed on
x86_64 and i686, unsigned on aarch64 and riscv64) cannot affect the output; no
plain-char value is ever printed. Pointer selection is observed only through an
equality comparison yielding 0 or 1, so no address appears in the output. The
floating-point values 1.0 and 2.5 are exactly representable and are printed with
%.2f, which was measured byte-identical across all twelve target-and-
optimization configurations. All four targets and all three optimization levels
are therefore compared, and all three oracles are enabled.
END
expected_stdout    <<END
const_true_branch r=10 branch_calls=1
const_false_branch r=20 branch_calls=1
runtime_true_branch r=10 branch_calls=1
runtime_false_branch r=20 branch_calls=1
nested_one_leaf r=1 branch_calls=1
size_char=4 size_short=4 size_int_double=8 size_float=4
const_int_double_branches=1.00
runtime_int_double_true=1.00
runtime_int_double_false=2.50
right_associative=10 20 30 40
pointer_branch_true=1
pointer_branch_false=1
void_branches_true branch_calls=1
void_branches_false branch_calls=1
in_argument=10 of_comparison=1
in_argument_other=6 of_comparison_other=0
compound_assignment=12
as_switch_control=1
END
